  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To initiate the process in the Pathology Department, begin with the Gross pathology request that has arrived."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "After that, proceed with the Registration gross pathology request."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "Once the registration is complete, assign a container to the gross pathology request."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "During the \"Registration gross pathology request\" step, make sure to create a barcode scan at the start."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "After assigning a container, move on to the Specimen description."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "For the \"Specimen description\" step, pay attention to the scan start."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "Then, pay attention to the scan end."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "Finally, pay attention to the scan start again for the Registration gross pathology request (cont.) step."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "Following that, proceed with Macroscopic description writing."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "Simultaneously, complete the following steps:"
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "Tissue processing,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "check if \"Digitalization?\" is required."
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "content": "If the answer is \"no,\" continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i14",
      "content": "If the answer is \"yes,\" proceed with Digitalization."
    },
    {
      "id": "i15",
      "content": "Next, check if \"Digitalization?\" is required again."
    },
    {
      "id": "i16",
      "content": "After that, assign cases to the pathologist and then move on to Microscopic examination and diagnosis."
    },
    {
      "id": "i17",
      "content": "Once the microscopic examination and diagnosis are complete, write the pathology report."
    },
    {
      "id": "i18",
      "content": "After writing the report, confirm it."
    },
    {
      "id": "i19",
      "content": "Once the pathology report is confirmed, deliver it. Then, proceed with the post-report processing."
    },
    {
      "id": "i20",
      "content": "To conclude the pathology procedure, close it."
    },
    {
      "id": "i21",
      "content": "Finally, deliver the pathology report and complete the post-report processing."
    }
  ]
